<title>USA: Oxford Resources buys 80 pct of 'Net firm.</title>
<headline>Oxford Resources buys 80 pct of 'Net firm.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oxford Resources Corp said Tuesday that it bought 80 percent of Electronic Vehicle Remarketing Inc.</p>
<p>The terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Oxford, a specialized automobile finance company, said it plans to utilize Electronic Vehicle's retail Electronic Car Lot and wholesale Electronic Auction systems to remarket off-lease vehicles.</p>
<p>Electronic Vehicle, a provider of used car sales, financing and auction technology over the Internet, would continue to market its systems.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
